Description: Remote Interface to Zino (Tcl/Tk client)
 Ritz ("Remote Interface to Zino") is a Tcl/Tk GUI client for the Zino
 network state monitor. It connects to a Zino server over the Zino line
 protocol and lets operators browse and manage cases (network alarms).
 .
 Ritz uses the Tnm Tcl extension for symbolic OID/MIB translation and the
 Tix widget set for its user interface. Its router menu shells out to xterm,
 telnet and traceroute, so those are hard dependencies rather than
 suggestions.
